# The design workshop's part picker (SelectPartWin) for chassis, from the loaded first turn (see selpart.c). Reached from the
# game menu: HQ, Design Workshop (the key U does not reach it in a scene); the workshop opens with a tour note.
# The picker is a window over the workshop: nine chassis in a grid of five cells across, the first one (infantry) the only one
# this faction can build (the others show the unavailable look). The window's own fields are in the state regions
# live_selpart_a, _b, _c, _scroll and _scroll2 (scene.c's live regions, written while it is open).
# Steps: opened; the mouse over an unavailable cell, over an empty cell, outside the grid; the keys (Right, Down, Left, Up,
# End, Home, a letter, PageDown, PageUp); a click on the available cell (it is chosen again); Escape; Return.
25 load
45 click 362 734         # the tutorial note
50 click 63 538          # MENU
52 click 20 376          # HQ
54 click 211 447         # Design Workshop
60 click 475 735         # the workshop's own tour note: Continue
63 state design 0x7334a4 0x30    # DesignWin: the chosen parts (0x141f4 on) and abilities
mask 395 215 620 400      # the workshop's turning 3-D model
